  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.3: Metadata-only patch. .mcp/server.json now declares 3 environment variables for MCP Server Registry discovery — DATA_GO_KR_API_KEY (secret), PUBLICDATA_TIMEOUT_SECONDS (default 30), PUBLICDATA_MAX_RESPONSE_LENGTH (default 50000). Pure descriptor change — runtime behaviour unchanged; ADR-001 credential resolution chain (env → Elicit, max 2 re-elicits) is unaffected. Pack-time VerifyServerJsonVersion MSBuild target catches drift between csproj <Version> and the two version fields in .mcp/server.json. publish-mcp-registry.yml GitHub Actions workflow (manual workflow_dispatch) drives the MCP Server Registry update via OIDC.",
